cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite this repository and software version. The published AMEP-1 Version 1.0 research report is separately identified by DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22561851."
title: "Adaptive Maritime Estimation and PNT (AMEP-1): A Falsifiable Resilient Multisensor Navigation and Autonomy-Authority Architecture for GNSS-Degraded USV Operation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Allit
    given-names: Gabriel V.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-2365-226X"
version: "0.3.0.dev0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GabrielAllit1/AMEP"
keywords:
  - resilient PNT
  - GNSS denial
  - maritime autonomy
  - USV
  - extended Kalman filter
  - multisensor fusion
  - sensor integrity
  - navigation authority
abstract: >-
  AMEP-1 is an EKF-centered research architecture for resilient maritime
  navigation and autonomy-authority supervision under GNSS-degraded and
  GNSS-denied conditions. This software remains a research/SIL prototype and
  does not constitute certified or field-validated navigation software.
